[h2]Build 0.9.14[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]A default title.[/b] On the Job titles page, press "Make default" on a title and every colonist holds it automatically as their lowest title, below any titles you give them. Colonists who join later get it too.
[*]The default title does not count toward the five-title limit, and can be switched off for single colonists in the Colonists view.
[/list]
[list]
[*]While a default title is set, every colonist holds a title, so the HR advisor reports on them but no longer changes anyone's priorities.
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
